   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "Divya, Sonam and Shivani are sitting in a queue of girls.\n\n• Divya and Sonam both are seated at the ends.\n\n• There are five persons between Sonam and Divya.\n\n• Shivani is sitting midway between Divya and Sonam. How many girls are sitting in the queue?",
